# Place YOLO model files here:
# - yolov8s.param (~300 KB)
# - yolov8s.bin (~22 MB)
#
# Download from: https://github.com/FeiGeChuanShu/ncnn-android-yolov8
# Direct links:
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FeiGeChuanShu/ncnn-android-yolov8/main/ncnn-android-yolov8/app/src/main/assets/yolov8s.param
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FeiGeChuanShu/ncnn-android-yolov8/main/ncnn-android-yolov8/app/src/main/assets/yolov8s.bin
#
# Or convert using pnnx from PyTorch YOLOv8 model

# Parking Intelligence garage-signage OCR (bundled):
# - signage_det.tflite     PaddleOCR en_PP-OCRv3 text detector  (fp16, ~1.2 MB)
# - signage_rec.tflite     PaddleOCR en_PP-OCRv3 text recogniser (fp16, ~4.3 MB)
# - signage_charset.txt    PaddleOCR en_dict.txt (95 symbols; blank=0, space appended)
# Source: PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR (Apache-2.0), ONNX exports by RapidAI/RapidOCR
# (Apache-2.0), converted with dev/export_signage_ocr.py (onnxslim + onnx2tf).
# A newer export placed in /storage/emulated/0/Overdrive/models/ overrides these.
